     ],
     "title": "AdoptTarget",
     "type": "object"
    }
   },
   "description": "What the provider makes of one address of protocol 1 (a card with many lines): a source of protocol 2 for each line of it the\nprovider plays, the codes of the lines it does not play, and the reason it came to none.",
